# GNOME-specific removals (appended to config/remove.list; same format).
#
# Fedora's gnome-shell hard-requires evolution-data-server (only its calendar
# event server, gnome-shell-calendar-server, links it) and WebKitGTK 6 (only
# the captive-portal login window, gnome-shell-portal-helper); e-d-s pulls in
# a second WebKit (4.1) besides. ~250M uncompressed for two helpers: both go
# (remove-files.list deletes the helpers and their D-Bus activation), the
# shell's calendar shows dates without events, and a hotel/airport Wi-Fi login
# opens in the user's browser instead of a shell window.
evolution-data-server*
webkit2gtk4.1*
webkitgtk6.0*
javascriptcoregtk4.1*
javascriptcoregtk6.0*
